00:03:14.840 --> 00:03:20.220
Episode 40
 Kio's Decision: 
Together with 
the Gundam

00:03:19.970 --> 00:03:22.680
Dad... Grandpa...

00:03:22.970 --> 00:03:24.930
I've decided.

00:03:24.930 --> 00:03:27.390
I'll fight my own way.

00:03:30.940 --> 00:03:34.690
{sign on screen - needs TL}One month ago

00:03:39.110 --> 00:03:42.320
Looks like we managed to escape from Second Moon.

00:03:42.320 --> 00:03:43.450
I'm glad it worked out.

00:03:44.450 --> 00:03:47.290
We managed to get the treasure back in one piece.

00:03:47.790 --> 00:03:49.660
No need to worry about us.

00:03:49.660 --> 00:03:51.210
Why don't you spend some time with{go see } him?

00:03:51.210 --> 00:03:52.830
He's your son, right?

00:03:58.840 --> 00:04:03.220
Now that I know what Vagan is like{about Vagan}, what should I do?

00:04:03.220 --> 00:04:04.680
What should I do?{what do}

00:04:15.100 --> 00:04:15.900
Kio.

00:04:19.730 --> 00:04:20.610
Dad!

00:04:24.200 --> 00:04:26.280
It's really you, isn't it, Dad?

00:04:26.280 --> 00:04:27.070
Yeah.

00:04:28.200 --> 00:04:29.370
Why?

00:04:30.120 --> 00:04:35.040
If you were alive, why didn't you come back to me and Mom?

00:04:38.630 --> 00:04:39.920
I...

00:04:39.920 --> 00:04:42.380
Whatever reasons you had...

00:04:44.720 --> 00:04:47.970
If you were alive, I wish you'd have come home.

00:04:52.980 --> 00:04:54.560
I'm sorry.

00:05:00.070 --> 00:05:01.400
I can't believe it.

00:05:01.820 --> 00:05:05.910
That's the true goal behind Ezelcant's invasion of Earth?{To be Hitler?}

00:05:05.910 --> 00:05:08.820
Yes. He said he'd select only the superior humans,

00:05:08.820 --> 00:05:12.080
then migrate them to Earth and create Eden.

00:05:12.080 --> 00:05:14.000
He must be out of his mind.{It seems insane.} {lit: he doesnt sound sane}

00:05:14.000 --> 00:05:17.790
But... he said it would save humanity.

00:05:18.380 --> 00:05:19.670
What do you think?

00:05:21.050 --> 00:05:24.760
All I know is that relations between Earth and Vagan

00:05:24.760 --> 00:05:28.800
have gone past the point of no return.{come to a point where there's no turning back.}

00:05:28.800 --> 00:05:30.050
Dad...

00:05:31.010 --> 00:05:33.980
So for now... I'll do what I can.

00:05:33.980 --> 00:05:36.640
To protect what's precious to me.

00:05:36.640 --> 00:05:37.730
Yeah.

00:05:46.400 --> 00:05:49.070
Everybody, brush your teeth properly!

00:05:49.070 --> 00:05:50.070
And also...

00:05:50.070 --> 00:05:51.240
We won't see you anymore?

00:05:51.240 --> 00:05:52.790
I don't want that!

00:05:52.790 --> 00:05:54.500
I wanna go with you!

00:05:54.500 --> 00:05:56.660
I told you that can't happen, right?

00:05:56.660 --> 00:06:00.920
The place we're going now is <i>very </i> dangerous.

00:06:00.920 --> 00:06:03.090
But... but...

00:06:06.050 --> 00:06:06.840
Look!

00:06:06.840 --> 00:06:08.510
Lucca!

00:06:09.180 --> 00:06:10.430
Hey!

00:06:10.800 --> 00:06:12.720
Hey, Taku!

00:06:12.720 --> 00:06:14.100
Yuu!

00:06:14.100 --> 00:06:15.850
Mama!

00:06:15.850 --> 00:06:18.020
Go on, now.

00:06:18.020 --> 00:06:19.850
Take care, you three!

00:06:19.850 --> 00:06:21.610
Yeah! You too, Wendy!

00:06:21.610 --> 00:06:22.690
Goodbye!

00:06:22.690 --> 00:06:24.690
Goodbye, Wendy!

00:06:26.690 --> 00:06:27.700
Mama!

00:06:28.950 --> 00:06:32.870
Take care, Wendy!

00:06:32.870 --> 00:06:35.120
Good luck with your work!

00:06:41.460 --> 00:06:42.790
<i>Goodbye.</i>

00:06:42.790 --> 00:06:44.840
<i>I'll do my best, okay?{Big sister will do her best, okay?} {herpaderpa}</i>

00:06:50.510 --> 00:06:53.260
<i>Baronoke, arriving on schedule. {arriving according to arrangemetns}</i>

00:07:05.650 --> 00:07:07.030
Aunt Unoa...

00:07:07.030 --> 00:07:08.280
Wendy...

00:07:08.280 --> 00:07:09.900
It's been three months, hasn't it?

00:07:09.900 --> 00:07:11.200
Kio!

00:07:11.910 --> 00:07:13.280
I'm so happy to see you!

00:07:13.280 --> 00:07:17.410
Jeez. {I and everybody else was so worried!}You had us all so worried!

00:07:17.410 --> 00:07:18.540
Sorry.

00:07:18.540 --> 00:07:21.870
Isn't there somebody else you should say that to first?

00:07:23.790 --> 00:07:27.210
Kio, do you know how worried I was?

00:07:27.210 --> 00:07:28.550
Mom.

00:07:30.630 --> 00:07:31.840
I'm so glad...

00:07:32.340 --> 00:07:34.010
Just so glad.

00:07:44.730 --> 00:07:46.480
Ase... mu?

00:07:47.780 --> 00:07:50.820
It's been 13 years, hasn't it?

00:07:58.240 --> 00:07:59.540
Asemu!

00:08:01.370 --> 00:08:03.830
I'm so sorry, Romary.

00:08:10.130 --> 00:08:11.920
What a mess.

00:08:11.920 --> 00:08:16.010
Unless we replace everything down to 
the frame, {it'll never be like it was}I don't think we can restore it.

00:08:16.010 --> 00:08:18.970
It was never our plan to simply restore it.{It was never the plan to make it like it was.}{awkward as fuck}

00:08:20.390 --> 00:08:22.060
We're gonna keep evolving it...

00:08:22.980 --> 00:08:25.020
into a new Gundam.

00:08:26.480 --> 00:08:27.440
Asemu.

00:08:27.820 --> 00:08:30.570
What were you thinking, becoming a space pirate?

00:08:30.570 --> 00:08:32.360
I had my reasons.

00:08:32.990 --> 00:08:34.030
Tell me.

00:08:35.490 --> 00:08:39.870
13 years ago, I was gravely injured in a battle

00:08:39.870 --> 00:08:41.950
and saved by space pirates.

00:08:42.330 --> 00:08:47.380
I lived among the pirates until I got back on my feet again.

00:08:48.630 --> 00:08:55.050
And while I was living with them, 
I learned the truth hidden behind this war.

00:08:55.050 --> 00:08:59.100
The EXA-DB you described in the message capsule?

00:08:59.100 --> 00:08:59.850
Yes.

00:08:59.850 --> 00:09:01.310
But not just that.

00:09:01.930 --> 00:09:06.400
The injustice of the Federation Forces, and the situation in the Mars Sphere that drove the Vagan to war...

00:09:07.020 --> 00:09:12.530
Knowing all this, I could no longer think of Vagan as one-dimensionally{simply} evil.

00:09:13.940 --> 00:09:17.660
So you became a pirate, allied with neither side?

00:09:17.660 --> 00:09:19.070
That's not it.

00:09:19.070 --> 00:09:22.160
I found my own way to fight there.

00:09:22.160 --> 00:09:23.330
What do you mean?

00:09:24.080 --> 00:09:29.130
I've been fighting to protect everyone, and I'll keep on doing so.

00:09:29.130 --> 00:09:35.550
But in fighting only for one side, will I truly be protecting them?{But fighting for one side or the other... Is that really protecting everyone?}

00:09:35.970 --> 00:09:37.510
So then I thought...{So I thought...}

00:09:37.510 --> 00:09:42.260
If war is inevitable, then I just have to keep both sides' strength in balance.

00:09:43.310 --> 00:09:48.770
By stealing the information and materials both sides needed for their operations,

00:09:48.770 --> 00:09:51.440
I've kept large-scale battles from taking place.

00:09:51.440 --> 00:09:54.690
That's what I've been doing as a space pirate.

00:09:54.690 --> 00:10:00.280
If I can keep the balance between Earth
 and Vagan, the war will reach a stalemate,

00:10:00.280 --> 00:10:02.620
and there'll be no major casualties.

00:10:02.620 --> 00:10:04.290
That's nonsense!

00:10:04.290 --> 00:10:10.960
If Kio and Romary, the people I love, 
can live in peace even in a world like this,

00:10:10.960 --> 00:10:12.710
then I can keep fighting.

00:10:12.710 --> 00:10:15.090
Your ideas are naïve!

00:10:15.590 --> 00:10:20.300
Unless we completely destroy those who commit 
massacre after massacre,{Unless we get rid of those who keep committing massacres} true peace will never come!

00:10:20.300 --> 00:10:24.720
We must win this war and {commit genocide!}eliminate the Vagan!{and how do you eliminate if not by massacre? lolhypocrite}

00:10:26.230 --> 00:10:28.060
I thought you'd say that.

00:10:28.060 --> 00:10:28.810
What?

00:10:29.520 --> 00:10:31.980
My ideas are different from yours.

00:10:32.610 --> 00:10:35.190
I'm fighting in my own way.

00:10:35.190 --> 00:10:38.490
That's the answer I've reached.

00:10:38.490 --> 00:10:39.780
Asemu!

00:10:41.200 --> 00:10:42.910
See you, Dad.

00:10:50.250 --> 00:10:51.460
You're leaving{going}?

00:10:51.460 --> 00:10:52.170
Yeah.

00:10:53.670 --> 00:10:54.880
Will I see you again?

00:10:54.880 --> 00:10:57.130
Yeah. You will.

00:11:08.850 --> 00:11:09.850
<i>Asemu...</i>

00:11:18.240 --> 00:11:20.530
I'm glad there's nothing wrong with you.

00:11:21.030 --> 00:11:23.490
I'm fine. I didn't need all those tests.

00:11:23.490 --> 00:11:28.120
There was no telling what they might have done to your body.

00:11:28.120 --> 00:11:33.210
And we had to be sure you weren't affected by the Mars Rays.

00:11:45.300 --> 00:11:50.230
Grandpa... the Vagan might not be as bad as you say.

00:11:52.600 --> 00:11:53.810
What are you saying?!

00:11:54.520 --> 00:11:59.690
Whatever their reasons, they've taken so many precious things from us.

00:12:00.190 --> 00:12:03.910
Grandpa, the people of the Mars Sphere are suffering too.

00:12:04.370 --> 00:12:06.530
So let's stop fighting!

00:12:06.530 --> 00:12:10.250
What nonsense have they been feeding you? {what have they been indoctrinacting you with, maybe "what stoires have they been feeding you"}

00:12:13.960 --> 00:12:14.960
That's ridiculous{idiotic}!

00:12:16.040 --> 00:12:20.010
So that's the reason behind Vagan's strange actions{the strange things Vagan has been doing}?

00:12:20.010 --> 00:12:20.880
Yeah.

00:12:20.880 --> 00:12:27.220
Using the war as an excuse to select the 
superior humans and weed out the weak ones.

00:12:27.220 --> 00:12:29.810
I'd expect that sort of scheme from them.

00:12:29.810 --> 00:12:36.230
But does that really make it right to just destroy them all?

00:12:36.230 --> 00:12:39.940
No matter what, Ezelcant is a mad tyrant.

00:12:39.940 --> 00:12:45.320
The Vagan who follow a man like that are nothing but enemies to be defeated!

00:12:45.320 --> 00:12:46.450
Grandpa...

00:12:51.080 --> 00:12:57.500
The goal of this operation is to take back the Luna base on the Moon's surface.

00:13:01.300 --> 00:13:04.380
The Luna base was once a Federation Forces stronghold.

00:13:04.930 --> 00:13:10.850
But while most of our main forces were
 diverted to deal with Vagan's Earth invasion,

00:13:10.850 --> 00:13:12.770
it fell into the hands of the enemy.

00:13:14.180 --> 00:13:16.730
Aaron Simmons, the commander of the Luna base,

00:13:16.730 --> 00:13:21.940
defected to the Vagans and let their 
sleeper agents infiltrate the base.

00:13:21.940 --> 00:13:26.110
Then, during the Vagan attack, those agents made their move.

00:13:26.950 --> 00:13:30.030
Most likely, all Federation soldiers were killed.

00:13:30.660 --> 00:13:34.750
The Luna base now functions as a support base for the Earth invasion.

00:13:35.330 --> 00:13:40.460
We previously received orders to send the Diva to the Luna base,

00:13:40.460 --> 00:13:43.960
but it's possible that was a Vagan ploy{trap, ploy} as well.

00:13:43.960 --> 00:13:51.310
To stop the Vagan's Earth invasion, we will now begin a decisive operation to recapture the Luna base!

00:13:53.220 --> 00:13:54.980
Kio, over here!

00:13:56.850 --> 00:13:58.900
Mr. Rody, you had something to show me?

00:13:58.900 --> 00:13:59.900
Yeah.

00:14:01.860 --> 00:14:02.780
Is this...

00:14:03.820 --> 00:14:05.860
a Gundam?

00:14:05.860 --> 00:14:11.990
It's the new machine the AGE System created 
based on AGE-3 combat data from the Mars Sphere.

00:14:11.990 --> 00:14:17.160
It's been made as light as possible to enable faster movement,

00:14:17.160 --> 00:14:22.590
and it's equipped with C-Funnels, which are 
small pursuit units designed for X-Rounders.

00:14:23.340 --> 00:14:24.510
Wow...

00:14:24.510 --> 00:14:28.880
This is the state-of-the-art Gundam, the AGE-FX.

00:14:29.430 --> 00:14:31.260
AGE-FX?

00:14:31.260 --> 00:14:34.060
FX stands for "Follow X-Rounder."

00:14:34.060 --> 00:14:37.100
It means that {the Sunrise people are faggots}it can keep up with the abilities of an X-Rounder.{It can keep up with an X-Rounder.}

00:14:37.100 --> 00:14:40.350
You could call it the ultimate Gundam.

00:14:41.650 --> 00:14:48.200
Mr. Rody, this Gundam can accurately 
target just one part of a mobile suit, right?

00:14:48.200 --> 00:14:51.450
Well, that depends on the skill of the pilot.

00:14:51.450 --> 00:14:54.950
But yes, it certainly does have the potential to do that.

00:14:56.410 --> 00:15:01.210
<i>With you, I may be able to realize what I'm trying to do...</i>

00:15:05.550 --> 00:15:07.260
<i>We're about to make contact with the enemy.</i>

00:15:07.260 --> 00:15:08.470
<i>Be careful.</i>

00:15:08.470 --> 00:15:09.090
<i>Roger!</i>

00:15:09.090 --> 00:15:11.010
Let's go, Gundam!

00:15:46.590 --> 00:15:47.590
It's starting.

00:15:48.710 --> 00:15:49.380
Here they come!

00:16:06.480 --> 00:16:07.270
<i>Kio!</i>

00:16:30.840 --> 00:16:32.170
What are you playing at?

00:16:32.170 --> 00:16:35.010
Send out an SOS, and have them pick you up.

00:16:35.800 --> 00:16:37.890
I'll do this <i>my </i> way.

00:16:40.890 --> 00:16:42.560
We're almost at the lunar surface.

00:16:42.560 --> 00:16:43.270
Prepare for landing!

00:16:48.190 --> 00:16:50.110
Deploy C-Funnels!

00:17:24.940 --> 00:17:26.600
The enemy are human beings, too.

00:17:26.600 --> 00:17:27.560
So...

00:17:34.900 --> 00:17:39.320
So I'll keep fighting in my own way.

00:17:39.660 --> 00:17:41.740
Dad... Grandpa...

00:17:43.540 --> 00:17:45.910
Kio? You're...

00:17:51.000 --> 00:17:54.300
Captain, prepare the Plasma Diver missile.

00:17:54.300 --> 00:17:54.970
Huh?

00:17:56.680 --> 00:17:57.800
What's wrong?

00:17:57.800 --> 00:18:00.930
Actually, I was uneasy about this when we departed.

00:18:00.930 --> 00:18:04.730
That weapon isn't approved for regular use.

00:18:04.730 --> 00:18:06.850
Why were we able to launch with it equipped?

00:18:06.850 --> 00:18:10.400
Commander-in-Chief Algreus gave his permission.

00:18:10.400 --> 00:18:11.980
But that can't be!

00:18:11.980 --> 00:18:14.900
It's far too powerful!

00:18:15.940 --> 00:18:19.360
Do you really mean to destroy the entire base?

00:18:20.780 --> 00:18:22.280
Former Commander Asuno!

00:18:23.200 --> 00:18:25.750
I've been following standard procedures.

00:18:25.750 --> 00:18:28.710
If you doubt that, go ahead and check.

00:18:31.710 --> 00:18:34.130
<i>I'll exterminate the Vagan myself.</i>

00:18:34.130 --> 00:18:36.050
<i>Every last one!</i>

00:18:39.590 --> 00:18:40.260
They're coming!

00:19:00.450 --> 00:19:02.870
Vary your movements, or they'll get the drop on you!

00:19:02.870 --> 00:19:03.870
<i>Sorry.</i>

00:19:12.080 --> 00:19:14.210
Heat sources detected over the Luna base!

00:19:19.840 --> 00:19:20.800
Kio!

00:19:45.530 --> 00:19:48.790
Enemy heat sources have disappeared!

00:19:53.710 --> 00:19:55.090
C-Funnels!

00:20:11.140 --> 00:20:13.400
<i>What I'm trying to do...</i>

00:20:13.400 --> 00:20:18.070
<i>It may be crazy and reckless, 
and maybe it has no chance of working.</i>

00:20:18.070 --> 00:20:21.610
<i>But you'll do it with me, right?</i>

00:20:24.030 --> 00:20:29.660
The Vagan don't need to hide their identity anymore, so they aren't self-destructing.

00:20:30.250 --> 00:20:33.750
Kio, are you fighting without killing your opponents?

00:20:35.000 --> 00:20:37.670
Everyone, we've almost reached the base.

00:20:37.670 --> 00:20:39.130
Stay focused and proceed!

00:20:39.130 --> 00:20:39.710
<i>Roger!</i>

00:20:45.800 --> 00:20:49.390
Captain, we're almost at the lunar combat sector.

00:20:49.390 --> 00:20:50.470
Got it.

00:20:50.470 --> 00:20:53.640
But why exactly are we doing this?

00:20:53.640 --> 00:20:58.400
If we don't return the Luna base to the Federation, it'll disrupt the balance between the sides.

00:20:58.400 --> 00:21:03.400
It'll be much easier to move forces 
from Vagan to the Earth Sphere.

00:21:03.400 --> 00:21:06.160
Perhaps even something very large.

00:21:06.160 --> 00:21:07.570
You can't mean...

00:21:07.570 --> 00:21:10.240
I hope I'm just overthinking things.

00:21:11.750 --> 00:21:15.670
Multiple enemy mobile suits are landing around the base!

00:21:15.670 --> 00:21:18.460
I never thought they'd attack in such large numbers.

00:21:18.460 --> 00:21:20.380
It doesn't matter.

00:21:20.380 --> 00:21:22.840
Our forces are enough to deal with them.

00:21:22.840 --> 00:21:24.170
Master Zeheart.

00:21:24.550 --> 00:21:25.760
Please take a look.

00:21:27.090 --> 00:21:30.430
<i>That's... Asemu?</i>

00:21:30.430 --> 00:21:32.850
<i>You should've stayed hidden.</i>

00:21:32.850 --> 00:21:36.810
Enemy mobile suits are in range 
of the short-range defense system.

00:21:37.270 --> 00:21:39.860
Defense systems, commence attack.

00:21:41.900 --> 00:21:43.490
<i>Come, Gundam.</i>

00:21:43.490 --> 00:21:44.950
<i>And Asemu.</i>

00:21:44.950 --> 00:21:47.320
<i>I'll finish things with you here!</i>

00:21:47.820 --> 00:21:49.490
Send three machines from D Block!

00:21:49.490 --> 00:21:50.990
Have them cover the Bart team!

00:21:51.450 --> 00:21:53.080
Rear guard, remain alert! {sup ribbons}

00:21:53.580 --> 00:21:57.460
Let's see what you can do.

00:22:13.100 --> 00:22:19.270
It seems I'll be leaving the finishing touches to you...

00:22:22.230 --> 00:22:24.150
I'm counting on you, Gundam.

